        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You're a digital creator, using programming, modeling, and your own creativity to transform raw universal polymer base (also known as UPBs) into valuable equipment. You might use high-tech equipment instead of hand tools, but the process is the same: dream, design, build.</p>\n<p>Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to <strong>Dexterity</strong> or <strong>Intelligence</strong>, and one is a free attribute boost.</p>\n<p>You're trained in the Computers skill and the Technology Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.feats.Item.Fabricator] skill feat.</p>"
